<title>DUBAI: Sharjah's Investbank 96 profits up, div steady.</title>
<headline>Sharjah's Investbank 96 profits up, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million dirhams unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income				    45.91     vs	 43.60</p>
<p> Profit available for appropriation    69.61     vs	 47.87</p>
<p> Net interest income			 55.66     vs	 47.28</p>
<p> Other income				  30.80     vs	 29.20</p>
<p> Provisions, other expenses		19.36     vs	 14.29</p>
<p> Total proposed cash dividend	    15.00     vs	 same</p>
<p> Assets					1,632.20    vs     1,520.55</p>
<p>Full Name: Investment Bank for Trade and Finance Plc.</p>
<p>Note - The Sharjah-based bank is owned by UAE nationals.</p>
</text>
